Package: resumeMatchR
Title: Simple Tools for Resume and Job Description Matching
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Nadika", "Sharma", , "sharman@lawrence.edus", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides simple text analysis tools for comparing resumes and job descriptions. The package includes functions for counting keywords, identifying missing skills, and calculating basic text similarity scores between resumes and job postings. It is designed to help users explore resume matching workflows using reproducible and beginner-friendly R functions.
